msgctxt "64"
msgid "Mommy!? You... *sniffle* You really came to find me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Of course I did! But Masa-kun... How did you get here all by yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"It was easy. I had the red balloon, so I knew you'd come to get me, just "
"like you promised!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "What is he talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Well, my husband and I went through a divorce last year, and\r\n"
"my ex was given custody of our son, Masa-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"As a condition of the divorce... I was never allowed to see\r\n"
"my son again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Mommy... I'm so happy to see you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Whenever we went into town, I always used to give him a\r\n"
"red balloon so I could find him if he ever got lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I told him that as long as he held onto it, he'd never be far away from me. "
"That he could always see me again, no matter how scary things got."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "So that's what this is about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Oh, I missed you so much, sweetheart... This is all Mommy's\r\n"
"fault."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Mommy, are you... crying?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Well, these are happy tears, sweetie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"At the same time, you're not legally allowed to see him.\r\n"
"So let's just say you two met up by chance today and leave it at that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"After all, you can't let a child go home alone in a city\r\n"
"like this. How about you take him most of the way?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "I doubt there'd be a problem with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Yes, you're right. Thank you so much, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Oh, and here's something for all you've done. I'm sorry it's\r\n"
"not in the best of shape, but I hope you can find it useful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Caviar Skin Bag<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Well, so long..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Bye, mister. Thanks for finding my mommy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "You got 8,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

